  "description": "Creation of an outbuilding/garden room with dimensions 5m x 3m at the rear of the large garden of the property.  The rationale for applying for a planning application is due to the apex height of the garden room which is above 2.5m due to the A frame design.  The usage of the room is for hobbies and a home office - there will be no plumbing/bathroom or bedroom usage.  The choice of room has been carefully considered using the organisation Green Retreats to fit in with both the aesthetic of the area and ensure an environmentally friendly build.  \n\n",
